 "selection": {
  "rule": "SELECT fix1_generator IFF (a) its selection metric is strictly greater than v15_generator's AND (b) fix1_generator is eligible; OTHERWISE v15_generator. Both candidates are evaluated with the fusion rule (simple), re-ranked k = 4 + fused repair, 3-seed mean, on the dev sets only.",
  "metric": "mean over VinDr dev (vindr_train_dev) and ReXGradient val of mean(CheXbert, SRR-BERT positive-only macro F1), seed mean per patient-bootstrap replicate, point value = replicate 0 (tools/ctrl_paired_suite.py 'selection'; suite v2 lists; the v15 governing selection metric)",
  "eligibility": "the v15 cap convention: the 3-seed-mean CheXbert normal false-claim rate on EVERY dev set (CheXpert val, VinDr dev, ReXGradient val) <= the exact v15 cap of that set; '<=' includes equality (1e-12 float tolerance, as tools/sota_gen_final_table.py)",
